0..80 Comment "//! A rule a theory\'s completion derives, stated as a declaration of its own and"
81..154 Comment "//! proved for every model: `rule T.r : l <=> r;` holds when the theory\'s"
155..234 Comment "//! completed rules rewrite both sides to one normal form, and the rewrites are"
235..309 Comment "//! the proof. The group\'s laws derive the inverse of a product: each rule"
310..386 Comment "//! completion derived on the way is proved first, from the two paths of its"
387..464 Comment "//! certificate, then the statement from both sides\' rewrites to their common"
465..544 Comment "//! normal form [Knuth-1970-simple_word_problems_universal_algebras], § 7. The"
545..611 Comment "//! rule is read at a model as the theory\'s member `Group.invMul`."
612..615 Comment "//!"
616..681 Comment "//! - cites: [Knuth-1970-simple_word_problems_universal_algebras]"
682..685 Comment "//!"
